  <name>UseCertificatesOfDiscrepanciesAfterShipmentForShipmentsOfGoodsToGiver2_5</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Use discrepancy reports following shipment by goods shipment to the provider</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>استفاده از گزارش‌های مغایرت پس از ارسال با ارسال کالا به تأمین‌کننده</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Utilizzare i documenti di accettazione con riserve dopo la spedizione per spedizioni merci al fornitore</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Używaj protokołów o odchyleniu po wysyłce z tytułu wysyłek towarów do właściciela surowców</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Использовать акты расхождений после отгрузки по отгрузкам товаров давальцу</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Ürünlerin alt yükleniciye sevk edilmesine ilişkin sevkiyat sonrası tutarsızlık raporlarını kullan</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Sử dụng biên bản chênh lệch sau khi giao hàng theo giao hàng cho bên đặt gia công</value>
  </synonym>
